# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# The service-worker precache manifest is a content hash of the shipped
# files. If Git rewrote line endings per-platform, that hash would differ
# between a Windows checkout and the Linux CI runner, and the
# `build_precache.py --check` gate would fail for no real reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
